[Episode 7]</font>

32
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:49,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

33
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you guys doing here?</font>

34
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enjoying the rain.</font>

35
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you so mad the second you see me?</font>

36
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family called the funeral home.</font>

37
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They sent us here.</font>

38
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

39
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So the family may not want an autopsy.</font>

40
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So who gets the body?</font>

41
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are we waiting or not?</font>

42
00:02:08,030 --> 00:02:09,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If there's an autopsy, it comes with me.</font>

43
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not, it goes with you.</font>

44
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go wait over there, out of the rain.</font>

45
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get back here.</font>

46
00:02:18,910 --> 00:02:21,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's my people. You don't give him orders.</font>

47
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move.</font>

48
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dr. Li.</font>

49
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:35,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You okay?</font>

50
00:02:36,030 --> 00:02:37,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And these two are...?</font>

51
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:39,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're from the funeral home.</font>

52
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:40,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice to meet you.</font>

53
00:02:42,910 --> 00:02:43,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dr. Li.</font>

54
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our community</font>

55
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is upscale and very private.</font>

56
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can see what we're dealing with.</font>

57
00:02:49,190 --> 00:02:50,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family is extremely upset.</font>

58
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're still deciding whether to have an autopsy.</font>

59
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And any minute now,</font>

60
00:02:55,470 --> 00:02:57,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the kids who live here will be getting out of school.</font>

61
00:02:57,630 --> 00:02:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those two from the funeral home...</font>

62
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your bias is pretty obvious.</font>

63
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're here to help.</font>

64
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:06,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

65
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

66
00:03:08,910 --> 00:03:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about that.</font>

67
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some people are pretty superstitious.</font>

68
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:19,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You get used to it.</font>

69
00:03:20,190 --> 00:03:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've got it pretty good.</font>

70
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are they still superstitious?</font>

71
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not superstitious.</font>

72
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But that's because we work in this field.</font>

73
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't afford to be.</font>

74
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:31,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many times does the average person</font>

75
00:03:31,190 --> 00:03:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">deal with something like this in their life?</font>

76
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only natural they'd be uneasy about it.</font>

77
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

78
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to make me feel better?</font>

79
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:39,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was I?</font>

80
00:03:43,910 --> 00:03:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you just standing here?</font>

81
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:45,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing better to do?</font>

82
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:53,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dr. Li.</font>

83
00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family has no doubts about the cause of death.</font>

84
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:58,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They signed the waiver declining an autopsy.</font>

85
00:03:58,910 --> 00:03:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry you came all this way for nothing.</font>

86
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as she didn't.</font>

87
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That temper of yours.</font>

88
00:04:03,150 --> 00:04:04,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take your umbrella.</font>

89
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring it back up to me later!</font>

90
00:04:05,590 --> 00:04:06,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come down and get it yourself.</font>

91
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:09,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get to work.</font>

92
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:20,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan, how do we even tell him?</font>

93
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just tell him straight.</font>

94
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How am I supposed to say that?</font>

95
00:04:24,950 --> 00:04:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not like we're returning a misdelivered package.</font>

96
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

97
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:30,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About the person who jumped from the 29th floor...</font>

98
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fall.</font>

99
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't say someone "jumped" unless you know that.</font>

100
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The person who fell from the 29th floor</font>

101
00:04:36,430 --> 00:04:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">accidentally left an arm at your place.</font>

102
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you mind handing it...</font>

103
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't say it.</font>

104
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it. I'll do it.</font>

105
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:49,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Lin.</font>

106
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We brought two professionals</font>

107
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to take care of this for you.</font>

108
00:04:52,830 --> 00:04:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What took you so long? Hurry up.</font>

109
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, sure.</font>

110
00:04:55,270 --> 00:04:56,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, wait.</font>

111
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back up. Keep going.</font>

112
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

113
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to go inside?</font>

114
00:05:01,310 --> 00:05:02,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can take</font>

115
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that body part,</font>

116
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you can't come through our home.</font>

117
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it?</font>

118
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:07,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But sir,</font>

119
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:09,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if we can't enter your apartment,</font>

120
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how are we supposed to take care of it?</font>

121
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to take care of it and remove it.</font>

122
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Figure something out.</font>

123
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get a fire truck. Bring in a crane.</font>

124
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or a helicopter if you have to.</font>

125
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just get it out of here.</font>

126
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, I understand how you feel.</font>

127
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Qingliangshan is responsible for this.</font>

128
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:23,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're the only ones who can pick it up.</font>

129
00:05:24,270 --> 00:05:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

130
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't touch anything in your home.</font>

131
00:05:27,310 --> 00:05:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay?</font>

132
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand completely.</font>

133
00:05:29,270 --> 00:05:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing here for you to touch anyway.</font>

134
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:33,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if that body part passes through our home,</font>

135
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it'll bring bad luck.</font>

136
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You understand that, right?</font>

137
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

138
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

139
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we're the only ones who can retrieve it.</font>

140
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we can't come through your home,</font>

141
00:05:38,950 --> 00:05:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- how can we get it? - That's not my problem!</font>

142
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to get it from outside!</font>

143
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bringing it through our home is bad luck!</font>

144
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:43,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not happening!</font>

145
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we're the only ones who can retrieve it.</font>

146
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:44,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That thing isn't coming through our door.</font>

147
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:47,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're here to help you solve this.</font>

148
00:05:47,410 --> 00:05:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're with management. Say something!</font>

149
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- That body part is bad luck! - Sir, sir.</font>

150
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Figure something out.</font>

151
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, sir.</font>

152
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

153
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know exactly how you feel.</font>

154
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why we brought this.</font>

155
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We completely understand your concern.</font>

156
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's actually very common.</font>

157
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So our director went out of his way</font>

158
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to get this cloth from a revered monk.</font>

159
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He had the monk bless it for us.</font>

160
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a sacred cloth.</font>

161
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the time comes,</font>

162
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll wrap the body part in it.</font>

163
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll seal all the bad luck inside.</font>

164
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your home won't be affected at all.</font>

165
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on! You can't be serious.</font>

166
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This old rag?</font>

167
00:06:20,430 --> 00:06:21,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch what you say.</font>

168
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't want to offend its powers.</font>

169
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look it up online.</font>

170
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a photo of our director with the monk,</font>

171
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">holding this exact cloth.</font>

172
00:06:41,270 --> 00:06:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You better not be lying to me.</font>

173
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'd never lie to you.</font>

174
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really was blessed.</font>

175
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, fine.</font>

176
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry. Come on.</font>

177
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

178
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

179
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, hurry.</font>

180
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:52,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

181
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, hurry!</font>

182
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't touch my carpet.</font>

183
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't disrespect the sacred cloth, honey.</font>

184
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey, didn't you call the firefighters?</font>

185
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are they?</font>

186
00:06:59,120 --> 00:06:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

187
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're more qualified than firefighters.</font>

188
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're the professionals.</font>

189
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

190
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop spraying!</font>

191
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:03,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

192
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you're trying to disinfect the place.</font>

193
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

194
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before we came,</font>

195
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we were fully disinfected.</font>

196
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And those bloodstains on your balcony?</font>

197
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That spray won't work on them.</font>

198
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have a special disinfectant mixed by experts.</font>

199
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll get everything spotless.</font>

200
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In a minute, she will</font>

201
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wipe down the entire balcony for you.</font>

202
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You hear that?</font>

203
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way!</font>

204
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you do it!</font>

205
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave it to the professionals!</font>

206
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, hurry!</font>

207
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on!</font>

208
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get this done!</font>

209
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did we get so unlucky?</font>

210
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just bought this place, and this happens.</font>

211
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One incident like this</font>

212
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:37,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could tank property values for the whole complex.</font>

213
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

214
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got some nerve.</font>

215
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now you're making up stories about the Head Director?</font>

216
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had no choice, Dandan.</font>

217
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just trying to solve the problem.</font>

218
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just needed an excuse to back down.</font>

219
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I gave him one.</font>

220
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An excuse, my foot.</font>

221
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This balcony is huge.</font>

222
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've wiped it three times already.</font>

223
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many more times do I have to do this?</font>

224
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't we have our sacred cloth?</font>

225
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- How much longer till we get there? - You thirsty?</font>

226
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you say, Dandan?</font>

227
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked if you're thirsty.</font>

228
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:34,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I'm not.</font>

229
00:08:34,790 --> 00:08:36,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Dandan. Thanks.</font>

230
00:08:36,910 --> 00:08:37,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep your eyes on the road.</font>

231
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you looking at?</font>

232
00:08:40,110 --> 00:08:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just checking if that's really Dandan back there.</font>

233
00:08:42,790 --> 00:08:43,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with you?</font>

234
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:45,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who else would it be?</font>

235
00:08:46,100 --> 00:08:47,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, that's more like it.</font>

236
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've just never seen Dandan care about anyone.</font>

237
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

238
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congratulations.</font>

239
00:08:53,150 --> 00:08:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That means Dandan finally accepts you.</font>

240
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan asked if I was thirsty.</font>

241
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So that means she finally accepts me?</font>

242
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Dandan.</font>

243
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:09,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't let you down.</font>

244
00:09:10,870 --> 00:09:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While Team Leader Cao's away,</font>

245
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll do my best as the team's good-luck charm.</font>

246
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:17,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks like</font>

247
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can's luck isn't bad.</font>

248
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even though we</font>

249
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ran into something this serious</font>

250
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and hit a few snags,</font>

251
00:09:24,670 --> 00:09:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we still got through it okay.</font>

252
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

253
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I guess so.</font>

254
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nasal defect, skin tissue loss.</font>

255
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forehead collapse.</font>

256
00:09:41,910 --> 00:09:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The facial features need reconstruction.</font>

257
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:45,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Comminuted parietal fracture and skull base fracture.</font>

258
00:09:45,790 --> 00:09:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Severe cranial trauma.</font>

259
00:09:49,030 --> 00:09:50,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle the bone reconstruction.</font>

260
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:52,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The entire left upper limb is fractured.</font>

261
00:09:52,910 --> 00:09:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Irregular wound edges and uneven wound surfaces.</font>

262
00:09:54,790 --> 00:09:56,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The muscle needs to be sutured back together.</font>

263
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll clean the wound and realign the tissue.</font>

264
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll suture the muscle and deep fascia.</font>

265
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave that to me.</font>

266
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I received the body today,</font>

267
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did a preliminary assessment.</font>

268
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's make a silicone mold.</font>

269
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get the entire body cleaned and prepared.</font>

270
00:10:11,870 --> 00:10:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Reattach the arm.</font>

271
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get photos from the family.</font>

272
00:10:14,870 --> 00:10:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Massage the body as you work.</font>

273
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That'll slow down rigor mortis.</font>

274
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Work out how long we'll need.</font>

275
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Disinfection plus basic embalming</font>

276
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will take at least six hours.</font>

277
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks like we're working all night.</font>

278
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have memorial services tomorrow morning too.</font>

279
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow's cases are elderly people who died of natural causes.</font>

280
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their makeup will be simple. It won't slow us down.</font>

281
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright. Thanks, everyone. Let's do this.</font>

282
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get started.</font>

283
00:10:36,510 --> 00:10:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

284
00:10:38,390 --> 00:10:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there anything simple</font>

285
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can help with?</font>

286
00:10:41,630 --> 00:10:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to pitch in too.</font>

287
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm part of the team.</font>

288
00:10:44,870 --> 00:10:46,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Teamwork is all about coordination.</font>

289
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly can you contribute?</font>

290
00:10:49,630 --> 00:10:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

291
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been out in the rain all day. Good work.</font>

292
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go home and get some sleep.</font>

293
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in early tomorrow.</font>

294
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can finally got Dandan's approval.</font>

295
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it. Thanks, Dandan.</font>

296
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take care, then.</font>

297
00:11:23,260 --> 00:11:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Every Prayer Answered]</font>

298
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great Sage.</font>

299
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got a feeling Fushan</font>

300
00:11:35,390 --> 00:11:37,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might be in for a rough few days.</font>

301
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:40,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please.</font>

302
00:11:40,790 --> 00:11:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Use your powers.</font>

303
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Talk some sense into the people of Fushan.</font>

304
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone knows how merciful you are.</font>

305
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It takes one second to give up on life,</font>

306
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but six hours to restore a body.</font>

307
00:11:55,390 --> 00:11:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not like you.</font>

308
00:11:56,870 --> 00:11:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have great powers.</font>

309
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We only get one life.</font>

310
00:12:00,730 --> 00:12:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, help everyone</font>

311
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stop before doing something drastic</font>

312
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and think it through.</font>

313
00:12:06,390 --> 00:12:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please.</font>

314
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:31,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speeding without a helmet?</font>

315
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you care that little about your own safety?</font>

316
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You only get one life.</font>

317
00:12:35,790 --> 00:12:36,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

318
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:37,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I know that line.</font>

319
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I rushed out the door</font>

320
00:12:39,340 --> 00:12:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and totally forgot my helmet.</font>

321
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuses. That's a 50-yuan fine.</font>

322
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:45,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Learn your lesson.</font>

323
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:51,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, I...</font>

324
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My phone's dead.</font>

325
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got any cash?</font>

326
00:12:54,510 --> 00:12:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

327
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you live far from here?</font>

328
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:57,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have someone from home bring it.</font>

329
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could I borrow your phone?</font>

330
00:13:00,510 --> 00:13:01,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll call my dad</font>

331
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:02,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and have him bring the money, okay?</font>

332
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

333
00:13:04,270 --> 00:13:05,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

334
00:13:06,750 --> 00:13:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad, what are you doing?</font>

335
00:13:08,390 --> 00:13:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Playing cards.</font>

336
00:13:10,550 --> 00:13:11,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

337
00:13:11,510 --> 00:13:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop playing for a minute.</font>

338
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drop what you're doing.</font>

339
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:15,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[North Jinma Road]
I'm on North Jinma Road.</font>

340
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On the west side of North Jinma Road.</font>

341
00:13:17,270 --> 00:13:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

342
00:13:17,750 --> 00:13:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's urgent. Really urgent.</font>

343
00:13:19,630 --> 00:13:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

344
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

345
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened to your face?</font>

346
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fell.</font>

347
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:33,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know what happened.</font>

348
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I rushed over.</font>

349
00:13:34,870 --> 00:13:35,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were going too fast!</font>

350
00:13:35,870 --> 00:13:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer,</font>

351
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when my son called,</font>

352
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I panicked,</font>

353
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- and I fell. - Right.</font>

354
00:13:40,750 --> 00:13:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son.</font>

355
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

356
00:13:44,030 --> 00:13:44,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's fine.</font>

357
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your son was speeding on his bike.</font>

358
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That violates road traffic safety regulations.</font>

359
00:13:50,030 --> 00:13:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fine is 50 yuan.</font>

360
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:53,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[North Jinma Road]
Why were you speeding?</font>

361
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were speeding too.</font>

362
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And neither of you had helmets.</font>

363
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Plus, you had an extra passenger.</font>

364
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's another 150-yuan fine.</font>

365
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So that's 200 yuan total.</font>

366
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:02,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead and pay the fine.</font>

367
00:14:02,290 --> 00:14:03,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer,</font>

368
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could you let us off or at least lower the fine?</font>

369
00:14:05,750 --> 00:14:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

370
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We really didn't mean to.</font>

371
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you knock a little off?</font>

372
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were in a real hurry.</font>

373
00:14:09,030 --> 00:14:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look what happened to my face.</font>

374
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:11,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't do that.</font>

375
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:12,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you hadn't broken the rules,</font>

376
00:14:12,910 --> 00:14:14,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you wouldn't have hurt your face like that.</font>

377
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you even know how to ride?</font>

378
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:24,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look what you did to my face!</font>

379
00:14:26,910 --> 00:14:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You little brat!</font>

380
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're entrapping me!</font>

381
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe.</font>

382
00:14:57,320 --> 00:15:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a severed blood vessel near the deltoid.</font>

383
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need you to ligate it again.</font>

384
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:03,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, I can't suture it properly.</font>

385
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

386
00:15:14,390 --> 00:15:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you take a break?</font>

387
00:15:15,910 --> 00:15:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can try working on the deltoid.</font>

388
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With a body like this, you don't "try".</font>

389
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His skin tissue is already very fragile.</font>

390
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

391
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Teamwork is all about coordination.</font>

392
00:16:00,750 --> 00:16:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly can you contribute?</font>

393
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom.</font>

394
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can explain, Mom.</font>

395
00:16:54,550 --> 00:16:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can explain.</font>

396
00:17:03,270 --> 00:17:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You look good in floral prints.</font>

397
00:17:06,310 --> 00:17:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a devoted son you are.</font>

398
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're never going to stop, are you?</font>

399
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Using your own mom for practice?</font>

400
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:13,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much do you hate me?</font>

401
00:17:13,350 --> 00:17:14,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom! Mom!</font>

402
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom! Mom!</font>

403
00:17:16,110 --> 00:17:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom!</font>

404
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom!</font>

405
00:17:20,220 --> 00:17:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom!</font>

406
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

407
00:18:07,790 --> 00:18:09,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're early. It's not time yet.</font>

408
00:18:09,790 --> 00:18:11,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I came in early on purpose.</font>

409
00:18:11,510 --> 00:18:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm new, so I'm slow.</font>

410
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I figured I'd get a head start.</font>

411
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please give me a little extra time.</font>

412
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:16,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get the job done.</font>

413
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't keep the deceased waiting.</font>

414
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't you see the makeup is caking?</font>

415
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Elderly skin has very little collagen.</font>

416
00:18:50,110 --> 00:18:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And after being bedridden so long,</font>

417
00:18:51,310 --> 00:18:52,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the skin is already severely dehydrated.</font>

418
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't use a pressure dressing and a wet compress first,</font>

419
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and go straight to makeup,</font>

420
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's definitely going to cake.</font>

421
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does that lip color look natural to you?</font>

422
00:19:00,350 --> 00:19:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And he's an elderly man.</font>

423
00:19:01,830 --> 00:19:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you make his lips so red?</font>

424
00:19:03,590 --> 00:19:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I...</font>

425
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:05,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I tried it.</font>

426
00:19:05,690 --> 00:19:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought it looked pretty natural.</font>

427
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:08,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put it on.</font>

428
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:12,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

429
00:19:12,830 --> 00:19:13,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

430
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:14,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll study it some more.</font>

431
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:15,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Study?</font>

432
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't practice on the deceased.</font>

433
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know. I won't.</font>

434
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are we about done?</font>

435
00:19:28,890 --> 00:19:30,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Final inspection for Du Yongtian's preparation.</font>

436
00:19:31,030 --> 00:19:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Head reconstruction.</font>

437
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Confirmed.</font>

438
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:33,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Skeletal reconstruction.</font>

439
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Confirmed intact.</font>

440
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Severed limb reattachment.</font>

441
00:19:35,550 --> 00:19:36,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Confirmed.</font>

442
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The restoration looks amazing.</font>

443
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With traumatic deaths,</font>

444
00:19:45,790 --> 00:19:46,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the better the restoration,</font>

445
00:19:47,310 --> 00:19:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the harder it can be for the family.</font>

446
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:56,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ready for viewing.</font>

447
00:20:41,750 --> 00:20:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

448
00:20:43,790 --> 00:20:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the body storage fee,</font>

449
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">basic sanitation fee,</font>

450
00:20:46,810 --> 00:20:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and disinfection fee.</font>

451
00:20:48,270 --> 00:20:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's everything.</font>

452
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Thanks.</font>

453
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu.</font>

454
00:20:53,440 --> 00:20:54,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go. I'm all packed up.</font>

455
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You go ahead.</font>

456
00:20:58,030 --> 00:20:58,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll wait for you.</font>

457
00:21:00,790 --> 00:21:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

458
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get someone to give me a hand.</font>

459
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:04,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhao.</font>

460
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew you guys would still be working.</font>

461
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Work, work, work. That's all you think about.</font>

462
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the point of working so hard?</font>

463
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you can eat well, right?</font>

464
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Personnel Office</font>

465
00:21:16,030 --> 00:21:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">asked me to bring you something nourishing.</font>

466
00:21:19,030 --> 00:21:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Authentic Mindong lamb.</font>

467
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thick skin, not much fat.</font>

468
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it a quick roast and it starts sizzling.</font>

469
00:21:26,110 --> 00:21:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's delicious.</font>

470
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

471
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:28,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mr. Zhao.</font>

472
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't have to bring it all the way down here.</font>

473
00:21:30,310 --> 00:21:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not cook it in the cafeteria?</font>

474
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can come up and eat.</font>

475
00:21:32,970 --> 00:21:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't keep it there.</font>

476
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Personnel Office said</font>

477
00:21:36,270 --> 00:21:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the other departments can't find out about the lamb.</font>

478
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to sneak it to you.</font>

479
00:21:40,310 --> 00:21:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They don't want the other departments complaining.</font>

480
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's reserved just for the mortuary prep team.</font>

481
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mr. Zhao.</font>

482
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where should we put this?</font>

483
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:47,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just find a freezer</font>

484
00:21:47,770 --> 00:21:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and stick it in there.</font>

485
00:21:49,020 --> 00:21:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

486
00:21:49,510 --> 00:21:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't put a sheep in our refrigeration room.</font>

487
00:21:51,350 --> 00:21:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just take it home when you get off work.</font>

488
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:55,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you have a fridge at home?</font>

489
00:21:57,240 --> 00:21:57,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

490
00:21:57,830 --> 00:21:58,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take care, Mr. Zhao.</font>

491
00:21:58,830 --> 00:21:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

492
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:00,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mr. Zhao.</font>

493
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm heading out.</font>

494
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Take care. - You too.</font>

495
00:22:03,110 --> 00:22:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

496
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go easy on breakfast tomorrow.</font>

497
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make you lunch.</font>

498
00:22:08,310 --> 00:22:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shandong-style braised pig's feet,</font>

499
00:22:10,790 --> 00:22:12,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sichuan-style pig's feet soup,</font>

500
00:22:13,070 --> 00:22:14,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guizhou rice tofu for the cold dish,</font>

501
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Fushan banana cakes for a snack.</font>

502
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mr. Zhao.</font>

503
00:22:18,350 --> 00:22:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll let you get back to work.</font>

504
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

505
00:22:19,830 --> 00:22:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Thanks. - See you.</font>

506
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:22,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At Qingliangshan,</font>

507
00:22:22,110 --> 00:22:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we eat our way across China!</font>

508
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:25,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

509
00:22:28,070 --> 00:22:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are we putting it?</font>

510
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:30,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't cook at home.</font>

511
00:22:33,110 --> 00:22:35,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, you can't even carry this?</font>

512
00:22:37,310 --> 00:22:37,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me.</font>

513
00:22:40,660 --> 00:22:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously.</font>

514
00:22:45,310 --> 00:22:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We should've been off ages ago.</font>

515
00:22:47,580 --> 00:22:51,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qingliangshan Funeral Home]</font>

516
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you call for a ride?</font>

517
00:22:57,750 --> 00:22:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been waiting forever.</font>

518
00:22:58,550 --> 00:22:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's go.</font>

519
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

520
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you pop the trunk?</font>

521
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't have any luggage. Why open the trunk?</font>

522
00:23:05,510 --> 00:23:06,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We do.</font>

523
00:23:10,510 --> 00:23:11,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is that?</font>

524
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't bring that over here!</font>

525
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay back!</font>

526
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not a person.</font>

527
00:23:13,510 --> 00:23:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not a person! Now you're insulting me?</font>

528
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:16,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Seriously, it's not. - Don't bring it over!</font>

529
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no!</font>

530
00:23:17,160 --> 00:23:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it away from me!</font>

531
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:18,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

532
00:23:19,510 --> 00:23:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put it here.</font>

533
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, look.</font>

534
00:23:20,750 --> 00:23:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't put that on my car!</font>

535
00:23:21,750 --> 00:23:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they won't take it, neither will I!</font>

536
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:24,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, look.</font>

537
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I'm not looking.</font>

538
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a sheep.</font>

539
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

540
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:30,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A sheep.</font>

541
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then don't put it in a bag like that!</font>

542
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:36,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, take it out!</font>

543
00:23:36,510 --> 00:23:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't put that on my car!</font>

544
00:23:38,030 --> 00:23:39,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I'd known, I never would've taken this ride.</font>

545
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:40,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously.</font>

546
00:23:51,750 --> 00:23:52,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You four</font>

547
00:23:52,790 --> 00:23:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">work at Qingliangshan Funeral Home?</font>

548
00:23:57,030 --> 00:23:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

549
00:23:58,160 --> 00:23:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're all so young.</font>

550
00:24:00,070 --> 00:24:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would you work at a place like that?</font>

551
00:24:04,750 --> 00:24:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your families don't mind?</font>

552
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:07,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then again,</font>

553
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:09,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they probably can't control you.</font>

554
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:11,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None of you went to college,</font>

555
00:24:11,070 --> 00:24:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right?</font>

556
00:24:11,830 --> 00:24:13,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Started working at 15,</font>

557
00:24:13,750 --> 00:24:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't you?</font>

558
00:24:14,510 --> 00:24:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

559
00:24:16,750 --> 00:24:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not really fair.</font>

560
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every profession has its experts.</font>

561
00:24:20,070 --> 00:24:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone has to do this work, right?</font>

562
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You sure know how to make it sound noble.</font>

563
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you've got a point.</font>

564
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't do it, who will?</font>

565
00:24:30,750 --> 00:24:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me ask you something.</font>

566
00:24:31,920 --> 00:24:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw a video online</font>

567
00:24:33,750 --> 00:24:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">saying that at your place,</font>

568
00:24:35,070 --> 00:24:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one night shift pays 1,800 yuan.</font>

569
00:24:38,310 --> 00:24:39,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that true?</font>

570
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you?</font>

571
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course you do.</font>

572
00:24:42,090 --> 00:24:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">1,800?</font>

573
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:44,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's nothing.</font>

574
00:24:44,790 --> 00:24:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We make 400,000 yuan for a night shift all the time.</font>

575
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I get free designer bags every day.</font>

576
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where we work,</font>

577
00:24:51,790 --> 00:24:54,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even antique money you never see anymore</font>

578
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is still in circulation.</font>

579
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew it.</font>

580
00:24:58,030 --> 00:24:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People who don't study hard</font>

581
00:24:59,510 --> 00:25:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and start working really young</font>

582
00:25:02,030 --> 00:25:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are the best at making money.</font>

583
00:25:03,460 --> 00:25:04,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Chen Hexu. - Take me, for example.</font>

584
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:06,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what?</font>

585
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to college like I was supposed to.</font>

586
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:08,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- You're sounding more human lately. - I even had a girlfriend.</font>

587
00:25:08,340 --> 00:25:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was supposed to go into research.</font>

588
00:25:09,940 --> 00:25:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Do you hear yourself? - But in the end,</font>

589
00:25:11,140 --> 00:25:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that didn't happen.</font>

590
00:25:11,780 --> 00:25:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now what do I do? I drive rideshare for a little over 100 yuan a day.</font>

591
00:25:13,560 --> 00:25:14,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You noticed?</font>

592
00:25:14,290 --> 00:25:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- 200 yuan. - I have.</font>

593
00:25:15,550 --> 00:25:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up.</font>

594
00:25:17,110 --> 00:25:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really have.</font>

595
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.</font>

596
00:25:28,830 --> 00:25:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure we're at the right place?</font>

597
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is what you called</font>

598
00:25:32,310 --> 00:25:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a healing haven for young people today?</font>

599
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:35,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

600
00:25:36,030 --> 00:25:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just look around.</font>

601
00:25:37,830 --> 00:25:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The GPS can't be wrong.</font>

602
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's check it out.</font>

603
00:25:54,750 --> 00:25:58,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A healing haven for young people.</font>

604
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

605
00:26:01,590 --> 00:26:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever been to Santorini?</font>

606
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No? Now you don't need to.</font>

607
00:26:04,550 --> 00:26:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is it.</font>

608
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:07,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's gorgeous.</font>

609
00:26:07,510 --> 00:26:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've seen celebrities on variety shows</font>

610
00:26:08,750 --> 00:26:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sitting around a fire by the ocean,</font>

611
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">making tea,</font>

612
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then talking and stargazing at night.</font>

613
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so jealous.</font>

614
00:26:15,510 --> 00:26:16,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to be jealous, sis.</font>

615
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're living the dream now.</font>

616
00:26:19,590 --> 00:26:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to thank Can.</font>

617
00:26:21,750 --> 00:26:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fish in the sea,</font>

618
00:26:22,890 --> 00:26:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lamb on my shoulder.</font>

619
00:26:24,830 --> 00:26:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Surf and turf. Can't get fresher than that.</font>

620
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every day with Can</font>

621
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">brings something fresh.</font>

622
00:26:30,750 --> 00:26:32,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's cook this lamb.</font>

623
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

624
00:26:34,750 --> 00:26:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your only job today</font>

625
00:26:36,270 --> 00:26:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is to have fun.</font>

626
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave everything else</font>

627
00:26:39,440 --> 00:26:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to me!</font>

628
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:41,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You sure?</font>

629
00:26:41,510 --> 00:26:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can handle it alone? You don't need us?</font>

630
00:26:46,550 --> 00:26:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

631
00:26:50,480 --> 00:26:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go!</font>

632
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looking good, Can.</font>

633
00:27:45,240 --> 00:27:46,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing we caught some seafood.</font>

634
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:47,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.</font>

635
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This solar-powered lamb roast of yours</font>

636
00:27:48,960 --> 00:27:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is taking a while.</font>

637
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it. Let's all pitch in.</font>

638
00:27:53,310 --> 00:27:54,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao, start the fire.</font>

639
00:27:54,310 --> 00:27:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shuang, let's put up the canopy.</font>

640
00:27:56,070 --> 00:27:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

641
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There. That's good.</font>

642
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's do it.</font>

643
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All done.</font>

644
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:05,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

645
00:28:05,310 --> 00:28:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try some.</font>

646
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dig in.</font>

647
00:28:08,510 --> 00:28:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can, have some seafood.</font>

648
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try it.</font>

649
00:28:09,920 --> 00:28:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad.</font>

650
00:28:10,640 --> 00:28:11,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See if you like it.</font>

651
00:28:11,790 --> 00:28:12,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, Can.</font>

652
00:28:14,480 --> 00:28:15,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- You guys eat. - Seafood.</font>

653
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have this.</font>

654
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is it?</font>

655
00:28:22,400 --> 00:28:23,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seasoning okay?</font>

656
00:28:23,510 --> 00:28:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

657
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just right.</font>

658
00:28:29,590 --> 00:28:30,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mao.</font>

659
00:28:30,550 --> 00:28:31,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

660
00:28:32,440 --> 00:28:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Um...</font>

661
00:28:34,310 --> 00:28:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not going to the Skills Competition.</font>

662
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been thinking.</font>

663
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:42,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a major competition.</font>

664
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A rookie like me would only</font>

665
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drag you guys down</font>

666
00:28:48,550 --> 00:28:49,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and embarrass Qingliangshan.</font>

667
00:28:50,160 --> 00:28:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we're not going.</font>

668
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:56,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

669
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think you're being a little full of yourself?</font>

670
00:28:59,070 --> 00:29:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just get to make every decision for us?</font>

671
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were the one who brought us here.</font>

672
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You insisted on roasting the lamb yourself.</font>

673
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wouldn't let us help.</font>

674
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:05,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you couldn't even get it done.</font>

675
00:29:06,350 --> 00:29:07,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the Skills Competition?</font>

676
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:08,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were the one who insisted we all go.</font>

677
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now you decide you're not going,</font>

678
00:29:10,790 --> 00:29:11,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we're not allowed to go either?</font>

679
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you stop making decisions for us?</font>

680
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

681
00:29:14,550 --> 00:29:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to respect our opinions.</font>

682
00:29:16,750 --> 00:29:19,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the very least, we should vote.</font>

683
00:29:22,110 --> 00:29:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

684
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's vote.</font>

685
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:26,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Raise your hand if you want to go to the Skills Competition.</font>

686
00:29:35,030 --> 00:29:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like this.</font>

687
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys really want to do this with me?</font>

688
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are we going or not?</font>

689
00:29:51,110 --> 00:29:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then it's unanimous.</font>

690
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:54,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Skills Competition, here we come!</font>

691
00:29:55,880 --> 00:29:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Food's ready!</font>

692
00:29:57,350 --> 00:29:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, dig in.</font>

693
00:29:58,680 --> 00:29:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat up.</font>

694
00:29:59,640 --> 00:30:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is really good.</font>

695
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The seafood's good too.</font>

696
00:30:02,680 --> 00:30:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try some.</font>

697
00:30:05,400 --> 00:30:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty good, right?</font>

698
00:30:06,070 --> 00:30:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a great cook.</font>

699
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:08,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheers with a skewer. Come on.</font>

700
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Skewer cheers!</font>

701
00:30:10,960 --> 00:30:12,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been busy all day. Have some water.</font>

702
00:30:12,300 --> 00:30:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We trade a knowing glance♪</font>

703
00:30:15,340 --> 00:30:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We hold our breath amid the noise♪</font>

704
00:30:18,260 --> 00:30:23,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪For this moment, the world stands still♪</font>

705
00:30:25,500 --> 00:30:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The romance left when the tide recedes♪</font>

706
00:30:29,380 --> 00:30:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Our story needn't reach the end♪</font>

707
00:30:31,860 --> 00:30:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Cast every regret into the clouds♪</font>

708
00:30:35,220 --> 00:30:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Just to hold on to this brilliance♪</font>

709
00:30:52,750 --> 00:30:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still nothing.</font>

710
00:30:54,270 --> 00:30:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Set the pickup at A-Xing's Food Stall.</font>

711
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We might get a ride there.</font>

712
00:30:55,920 --> 00:30:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can, look where you brought us.</font>

713
00:30:57,400 --> 00:30:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't even get a ride out here.</font>

714
00:30:59,350 --> 00:31:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you just say this felt like a variety show?</font>

715
00:31:01,440 --> 00:31:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, enjoy the view a little longer.</font>

716
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:04,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nice. We don't get views like this at the funeral home.</font>

717
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really is beautiful.</font>

718
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got one. Our ride's here!</font>

719
00:31:19,200 --> 00:31:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a car!</font>

720
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, buddy! Hop in!</font>

721
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

722
00:31:23,480 --> 00:31:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey.</font>

723
00:31:24,210 --> 00:31:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this the driver who brought us here?</font>

724
00:31:25,350 --> 00:31:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember him?</font>

725
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were bragging to him.</font>

726
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's probably waiting to rip us off.</font>

727
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just get in.</font>

728
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You won't find a ride out here.</font>

729
00:31:31,030 --> 00:31:31,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

730
00:31:31,470 --> 00:31:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We got one. We got a ride.</font>

731
00:31:32,760 --> 00:31:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, sir. Let's go.</font>

732
00:31:33,360 --> 00:31:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's go.</font>

733
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:36,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on. It's about to rain.</font>

734
00:31:36,640 --> 00:31:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

735
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's going to rain soon.</font>

736
00:31:38,260 --> 00:31:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I actually never left.</font>

737
00:31:40,270 --> 00:31:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been waiting nearby for you.</font>

738
00:31:41,920 --> 00:31:43,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't get a ride out here.</font>

739
00:31:45,350 --> 00:31:45,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

740
00:31:46,160 --> 00:31:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's really kind of you.</font>

741
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing you're here.</font>

742
00:31:48,880 --> 00:31:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were starting to worry.</font>

743
00:31:49,720 --> 00:31:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll cancel this ride.</font>

744
00:31:58,400 --> 00:32:00,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your car is spotless.</font>

745
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rideshare driving isn't easy.</font>

746
00:32:02,920 --> 00:32:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

747
00:32:04,200 --> 00:32:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all your expenses,</font>

748
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how much do you actually make a day?</font>

749
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe 300 or 400 yuan on a good day.</font>

750
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:11,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On a slow day, 100 or 200.</font>

751
00:32:11,790 --> 00:32:13,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's about what we make.</font>

752
00:32:14,200 --> 00:32:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

753
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:17,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our job isn't nearly as crazy as people say.</font>

754
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We work overtime every day</font>

755
00:32:19,480 --> 00:32:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and stay up all night.</font>

756
00:32:20,310 --> 00:32:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We still might only make 200 or 300 yuan a day.</font>

757
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're afraid I'll charge you 1,800, aren't you?</font>

758
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

759
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

760
00:32:26,250 --> 00:32:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's all just a misunderstanding about our job.</font>

761
00:32:28,550 --> 00:32:29,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually...</font>

762
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, explain it to him.</font>

763
00:32:31,070 --> 00:32:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell him what that 400,000 really was.</font>

764
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The 400,000 was spirit money.</font>

765
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each bill has a face value of 10,000.</font>

766
00:32:37,160 --> 00:32:37,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

767
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

768
00:32:38,830 --> 00:32:40,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And those designer bags of mine are made of paper.</font>

769
00:32:41,270 --> 00:32:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't actually use them.</font>

770
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And that antique money</font>

771
00:32:42,920 --> 00:32:44,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is really just used in rites for the deceased.</font>

772
00:32:44,790 --> 00:32:45,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

773
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It just passes through our hands.</font>

774
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you guys were joking.</font>

775
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

776
00:32:49,680 --> 00:32:50,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I mean is,</font>

777
00:32:50,790 --> 00:32:51,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whatever the ride cost on the way here,</font>

778
00:32:51,790 --> 00:32:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whatever the app quoted us,</font>

779
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll just pay that amount.</font>

780
00:32:55,350 --> 00:32:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

781
00:32:57,200 --> 00:32:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry, buddy.</font>

782
00:32:59,270 --> 00:32:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For this ride,</font>

783
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not charging you the app fare.</font>

784
00:33:02,590 --> 00:33:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, sir.</font>

785
00:33:03,480 --> 00:33:05,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're broke too.</font>

786
00:33:05,350 --> 00:33:06,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This ride's on me.</font>

787
00:33:10,310 --> 00:33:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

788
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

789
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:18,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom passed away eight years ago.</font>

790
00:33:19,160 --> 00:33:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She'd been in the hospital a long time before that.</font>

791
00:33:23,110 --> 00:33:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was lying in a hospital bed</font>

792
00:33:24,030 --> 00:33:25,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and had to use a ventilator.</font>

793
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It had a face mask.</font>

794
00:33:28,070 --> 00:33:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

795
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:29,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That mask</font>

796
00:33:30,550 --> 00:33:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sat against her face,</font>

797
00:33:31,480 --> 00:33:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and over time, it rubbed her skin raw.</font>

798
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we didn't know that then.</font>

799
00:33:37,350 --> 00:33:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Mom passed away</font>

800
00:33:39,110 --> 00:33:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and they took the mask off,</font>

801
00:33:40,680 --> 00:33:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my sister and I were shocked.</font>

802
00:33:42,550 --> 00:33:44,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her face was badly chafed all over.</font>

803
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the time...</font>

804
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:56,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really broke our hearts.</font>

805
00:33:56,550 --> 00:33:58,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom had such a hard life.</font>

806
00:33:58,680 --> 00:34:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even her final days were so hard.</font>

807
00:34:05,880 --> 00:34:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we took her to Qingliangshan.</font>

808
00:34:08,400 --> 00:34:11,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We heard you could restore her appearance.</font>

809
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:12,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After you were done,</font>

810
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:15,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my sister and I couldn't believe it.</font>

811
00:34:16,230 --> 00:34:17,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom looked</font>

812
00:34:17,960 --> 00:34:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">beautiful.</font>

813
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She really did.</font>

814
00:34:19,880 --> 00:34:21,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You couldn't tell she'd been hurt at all.</font>

815
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She got a beautiful farewell.</font>

816
00:34:27,630 --> 00:34:28,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was enough for us.</font>

817
00:34:30,020 --> 00:34:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My sister said</font>

818
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it felt like Mom had lived</font>

819
00:34:34,110 --> 00:34:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a life of comfort and abundance,</font>

820
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:37,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like she'd never suffered at all.</font>

821
00:34:38,630 --> 00:34:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the greatest comfort a family can get.</font>

822
00:34:41,210 --> 00:34:41,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

823
00:34:42,030 --> 00:34:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm pretty superstitious myself.</font>

824
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you first got in,</font>

825
00:34:46,840 --> 00:34:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wasn't too happy about it.</font>

826
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But then I remembered</font>

827
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:52,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your people had helped my mom.</font>

828
00:34:53,550 --> 00:34:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I...</font>

829
00:34:55,510 --> 00:34:56,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still wanted</font>

830
00:34:56,920 --> 00:34:58,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to thank you in person.</font>

831
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if it was eight years ago,</font>

832
00:35:08,070 --> 00:35:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it probably wasn't any of us.</font>

833
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was probably Dandan.</font>

834
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

835
00:35:12,550 --> 00:35:15,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan's the best at restoring wounds like that.</font>

836
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:17,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What, she's your coworker?</font>

837
00:35:17,510 --> 00:35:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's our senior.</font>

838
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

839
00:35:19,480 --> 00:35:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

840
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you have to tell Dandan...</font>

841
00:35:22,920 --> 00:35:23,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell her thank you for me.</font>

842
00:35:23,760 --> 00:35:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

843
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll make sure she gets the message.</font>

844
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

845
00:35:33,960 --> 00:35:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you feel</font>

846
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:37,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">having us pass along your thanks</font>

847
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">isn't enough,</font>

848
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you could always send us a thank-you banner.</font>

849
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I already gave you a free ride.</font>

850
00:35:47,070 --> 00:35:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't a banner on top of that a little much?</font>

851
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:53,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm kidding.</font>

852
00:35:53,590 --> 00:35:54,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

853
00:35:55,070 --> 00:35:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

854
00:36:10,290 --> 00:36:11,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, hurry!</font>

855
00:36:12,020 --> 00:36:12,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coming!</font>

856
00:36:19,670 --> 00:36:20,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom.</font>

857
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:21,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

858
00:36:21,910 --> 00:36:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The funeral home told us to stand by.</font>

859
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're here too?</font>

860
00:36:24,840 --> 00:36:26,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you get the alert?</font>

861
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you got the alert...</font>

862
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's go!</font>

863
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:29,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's raining.</font>

864
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, hurry! Over here!</font>

865
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:33,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hearses,</font>

866
00:36:33,880 --> 00:36:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">turn around and stand by.</font>

867
00:36:34,800 --> 00:36:36,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All other vehicles, this way.</font>

868
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:38,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bikes and e-bikes,</font>

869
00:36:38,190 --> 00:36:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come over here.</font>

870
00:36:40,030 --> 00:36:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad.</font>

871
00:36:40,920 --> 00:36:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on? Why is Mom here?</font>

872
00:36:42,630 --> 00:36:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

873
00:36:43,670 --> 00:36:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The communications building in Chengnan District caught fire.</font>

874
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are a lot of employees inside.</font>

875
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why weren't we notified?</font>

876
00:36:48,590 --> 00:36:49,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

877
00:36:49,190 --> 00:36:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- In a major emergency like this... - This way!</font>

878
00:36:50,150 --> 00:36:51,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the fleet gets notified first.</font>

879
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:53,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hopefully we won't have to make a run.</font>

880
00:36:54,320 --> 00:36:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

881
00:36:55,190 --> 00:36:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we do, hopefully we come back empty.</font>

882
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:59,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go upstairs and stand by. Hurry.</font>

883
00:36:59,510 --> 00:37:00,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- All other vehicles, this way. - Hurry!</font>

884
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

885
00:37:01,630 --> 00:37:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll head up with them.</font>

886
00:37:02,920 --> 00:37:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll park first.</font>

887
00:37:04,020 --> 00:37:04,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go park.</font>

888
00:37:04,590 --> 00:37:05,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad.</font>

889
00:37:05,550 --> 00:37:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom.</font>

890
00:37:06,780 --> 00:37:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're just standing by for now, right?</font>

891
00:37:08,450 --> 00:37:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No casualties have been reported, right?</font>

892
00:37:10,140 --> 00:37:11,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We may not have to work late tonight.</font>

893
00:37:11,840 --> 00:37:13,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is just a precaution, understand?</font>

894
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

895
00:37:14,320 --> 00:37:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao, Tianshuang.</font>

896
00:37:16,400 --> 00:37:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you two put those outfits on?</font>

897
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

898
00:37:20,150 --> 00:37:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang.</font>

899
00:37:21,590 --> 00:37:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What outfits?</font>

900
00:37:27,190 --> 00:37:29,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone's here. Let me brief you.</font>

901
00:37:30,030 --> 00:37:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So far,</font>

902
00:37:31,400 --> 00:37:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the communications building fire</font>

903
00:37:32,510 --> 00:37:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is still being handled as a safety incident.</font>

904
00:37:34,590 --> 00:37:35,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The funeral home hasn't received</font>

905
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">any casualty reports yet.</font>

906
00:37:37,110 --> 00:37:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But starting now,</font>

907
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we need to make all necessary preparations.</font>

908
00:37:41,280 --> 00:37:42,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fire victims' remains</font>

909
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:44,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are exposed to extreme heat.</font>

910
00:37:44,230 --> 00:37:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As moisture evaporates from the skin,</font>

911
00:37:45,550 --> 00:37:47,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it can become leathery or charred.</font>

912
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For restorative work...</font>

913
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll develop the reconstruction plan.</font>

914
00:37:50,400 --> 00:37:52,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the deceased is severely dehydrated</font>

915
00:37:52,510 --> 00:37:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the humidity drops,</font>

916
00:37:53,880 --> 00:37:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the skin tissue</font>

917
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and tiny blood vessels under it may rupture,</font>

918
00:37:56,590 --> 00:37:57,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">preventing embalming fluid from being absorbed.</font>

919
00:37:57,880 --> 00:37:59,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If standard embalming doesn't work...</font>

920
00:37:59,510 --> 00:38:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try subcutaneous injections</font>

921
00:38:00,510 --> 00:38:01,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">along with cold preservation.</font>

922
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Adapt as needed for special cases.</font>

923
00:38:03,630 --> 00:38:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The limbs and torso may spasm and shrink.</font>

924
00:38:05,960 --> 00:38:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be extra careful when dressing them.</font>

925
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For identification and family support,</font>

926
00:38:09,670 --> 00:38:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, you'll handle that with me.</font>

927
00:38:11,400 --> 00:38:11,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

928
00:38:12,070 --> 00:38:14,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll also need to support the rest of the team.</font>

929
00:38:14,150 --> 00:38:15,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help out wherever you're needed.</font>

930
00:38:16,230 --> 00:38:16,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

931
00:38:17,110 --> 00:38:17,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director,</font>

932
00:38:18,800 --> 00:38:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why aren't we wearing the new suits?</font>

933
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:22,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we do receive any remains,</font>

934
00:38:23,070 --> 00:38:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll change into brand-new protective suits.</font>

935
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:26,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three years ago,</font>

936
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">during the Houshawei Village flood,</font>

937
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we waited here in these same suits.</font>

938
00:38:30,510 --> 00:38:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A lot of people were caught in the flood.</font>

939
00:38:32,280 --> 00:38:33,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We prepared for the worst.</font>

940
00:38:34,110 --> 00:38:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But in the end,</font>

941
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the medical teams managed to save</font>

942
00:38:36,280 --> 00:38:37,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone who was in the water.</font>

943
00:38:37,110 --> 00:38:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There were no fatalities.</font>

944
00:38:39,550 --> 00:38:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we never threw these suits away.</font>

945
00:38:41,920 --> 00:38:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one you're wearing belonged to Team Leader Cao.</font>

946
00:38:44,550 --> 00:38:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever since then, whenever there's an emergency,</font>

947
00:38:46,670 --> 00:38:48,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we put these suits back on.</font>

948
00:38:48,840 --> 00:38:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe they've become our good-luck charm.</font>

949
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:51,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whenever we wear them,</font>

950
00:38:51,710 --> 00:38:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one ends up coming here.</font>

951
00:38:54,550 --> 00:38:55,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At times like this,</font>

952
00:38:55,630 --> 00:38:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">here at Qingliangshan,</font>

953
00:38:57,280 --> 00:38:58,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what else can we do?</font>

954
00:38:58,840 --> 00:38:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter what happens,</font>

955
00:39:00,030 --> 00:39:00,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is our way of saying</font>

956
00:39:01,590 --> 00:39:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we hope no one comes here.</font>

957
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand!</font>

958
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:07,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on. Let's go to Central Square.</font>

959
00:39:17,100 --> 00:39:19,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Vehicle]</font>

960
00:39:19,230 --> 00:39:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chengnan Central District]
Viewers,</font>

961
00:39:19,960 --> 00:39:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Telecom Building Fire]
we now bring you</font>

962
00:39:21,040 --> 00:39:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Possible AC Unit Fire]
a breaking report.</font>

963
00:39:22,670 --> 00:39:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At 7:40 tonight,</font>

964
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the telecom building in Chengnan Central District</font>

965
00:39:26,590 --> 00:39:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">caught fire,</font>

966
00:39:27,630 --> 00:39:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drawing widespread attention nearby.</font>

967
00:39:30,070 --> 00:39:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">According to initial reports,</font>

968
00:39:31,400 --> 00:39:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the fire may have been caused</font>

969
00:39:33,030 --> 00:39:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by an outdoor AC unit catching fire.</font>

970
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After the fire broke out,</font>

971
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:38,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fire, police, and emergency services</font>

972
00:39:38,320 --> 00:39:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">quickly mobilized.</font>

973
00:39:39,320 --> 00:39:40,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nearly 20 fire trucks</font>

974
00:39:40,670 --> 00:39:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and over 100 firefighters joined the rescue.</font>

975
00:39:43,150 --> 00:39:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fire has been burning for about 30 minutes.</font>

976
00:39:45,590 --> 00:39:46,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nearby residents say</font>

977
00:39:46,800 --> 00:39:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they have not yet experienced</font>

978
00:39:48,190 --> 00:39:49,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">any power or internet outages.</font>

979
00:39:49,960 --> 00:39:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Authorities have advised nearby residents</font>

980
00:39:51,960 --> 00:39:53,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to keep windows and doors shut and stay inside.</font>

981
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll continue to follow this story</font>

982
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and bring you updates as they come.</font>

983
00:40:19,580 --> 00:40:23,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fushan News: Latest on Telecom Building Fire]</font>

984
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you're worried.</font>

985
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:26,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try not to stress too much.</font>

986
00:40:27,550 --> 00:40:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to trust that we're professionals.</font>

987
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The firefighters, police, and doctors</font>

988
00:40:32,110 --> 00:40:33,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are professionals too.</font>

989
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:35,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've run a 4x100-meter relay, right?</font>

990
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fire, police, medical, emergency services...</font>

991
00:40:40,070 --> 00:40:41,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They pass the baton from one to the next.</font>

992
00:40:42,320 --> 00:40:44,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If none of them can outrun death,</font>

993
00:40:45,150 --> 00:40:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then the final baton comes to us.</font>

994
00:40:50,190 --> 00:40:52,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're the last leg, after the race is over.</font>

995
00:40:52,920 --> 00:40:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they lose,</font>

996
00:40:54,670 --> 00:40:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we still have to take the baton.</font>

997
00:40:58,230 --> 00:40:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

998
00:40:59,670 --> 00:41:01,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know what you mean.</font>

999
00:41:01,880 --> 00:41:03,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're all racing against death.</font>

1000
00:41:03,880 --> 00:41:05,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes we lose. There's nothing we can do.</font>

1001
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But isn't our job to make sure</font>

1002
00:41:08,630 --> 00:41:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that even in defeat, there's still dignity?</font>

1003
00:41:11,360 --> 00:41:12,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I think</font>

1004
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sometimes the makeup you do for the deceased</font>

1005
00:41:15,630 --> 00:41:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes it look like</font>

1006
00:41:17,590 --> 00:41:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they fought death to a draw.</font>

1007
00:41:21,150 --> 00:41:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

1008
00:41:26,670 --> 00:41:27,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

1009
00:41:27,110 --> 00:41:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you tell us</font>

1010
00:41:27,920 --> 00:41:29,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what happened inside the building today?</font>

1011
00:41:29,960 --> 00:41:30,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our department was on duty today.</font>

1012
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:31,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We got an update.</font>

1013
00:41:31,230 --> 00:41:32,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were right on the floor where the fire started.</font>

1014
00:41:33,320 --> 00:41:35,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There were over 100 people there.</font>

1015
00:41:35,480 --> 00:41:37,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We work in telecommunications,</font>

1016
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:38,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we have to keep the network running.</font>

1017
00:41:39,320 --> 00:41:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why our shifts</font>

1018
00:41:40,510 --> 00:41:42,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">run around the clock.</font>

1019
00:41:42,320 --> 00:41:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

1020
00:41:45,360 --> 00:41:45,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

1021
00:41:46,370 --> 00:41:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry! Hurry!</font>

1022
00:41:53,070 --> 00:41:55,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">According to staff inside the building,</font>

1023
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:57,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">although it's outside normal business hours,</font>

1024
00:41:57,190 --> 00:41:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there are still</font>

1025
00:41:58,070 --> 00:42:00,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">120 night-shift employees</font>

1026
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on duty.</font>

1027
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fushan Emergency Center</font>

1028
00:42:02,630 --> 00:42:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has deployed extensive medical resources</font>

1029
00:42:04,510 --> 00:42:05,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stand by at the scene.</font>

1030
00:42:05,710 --> 00:42:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fire has spread to the middle and upper floors.</font>

1031
00:42:08,660 --> 00:42:10,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Telecom Building Fire in Chengnan District, Fushan]</font>

1032
00:42:10,020 --> 00:42:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[13 People Still Trapped]</font>

1033
00:42:12,150 --> 00:42:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are still 13 people trapped inside.</font>

1034
00:42:15,550 --> 00:42:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just saw that too.</font>

1035
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Firefighters</font>

1036
00:42:17,140 --> 00:42:18,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- are on scene. - Thirteen? Thirteen?</font>

1037
00:42:18,670 --> 00:42:19,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rescue efforts are underway.</font>

1038
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Firefighting operations are still ongoing.</font>

1039
00:43:02,710 --> 00:43:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, Director.</font>

1040
00:43:08,880 --> 00:43:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director.</font>

1041
00:43:09,630 --> 00:43:10,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you say that again, please?</font>

1042
00:43:12,190 --> 00:43:13,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, listen up.</font>

1043
00:43:14,510 --> 00:43:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The incident command has confirmed</font>

1044
00:43:18,070 --> 00:43:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the fire is fully extinguished.</font>

1045
00:43:21,670 --> 00:43:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The building has been fully searched.</font>

1046
00:43:23,840 --> 00:43:25,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are no deaths or serious injuries!</font>

1047
00:43:34,110 --> 00:43:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The alert's been lifted. Everyone's safe.</font>

1048
00:43:36,110 --> 00:43:37,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stand down!</font>

1049
00:43:37,320 --> 00:43:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good!</font>

1050
00:43:38,960 --> 00:43:40,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good!</font>

1051
00:44:33,500 --> 00:44:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Good Night Signature - Lucky Charm]</font>

1052
00:44:42,480 --> 00:44:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get out of these suits.</font>

1053
00:44:44,360 --> 00:44:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need a break.</font>

1054
00:44:47,110 --> 00:44:48,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao, you're finally back!</font>

1055
00:44:48,920 --> 00:44:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Welcome back! - We missed you so much!</font>

1056
00:44:50,590 --> 00:44:51,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard.</font>

1057
00:44:51,840 --> 00:44:52,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was a close one.</font>

1058
00:44:53,400 --> 00:44:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, how did that thing go?</font>

1059
00:44:58,590 --> 00:44:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That suit fits you pretty well.</font>

1060
00:44:59,880 --> 00:45:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. It's yours, after all.</font>

1061
00:45:01,800 --> 00:45:02,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So how did it go?</font>

1062
00:45:03,880 --> 00:45:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, those? I got them at the airport.</font>

1063
00:45:05,800 --> 00:45:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The real deal. One bag for each of you.</font>

1064
00:45:07,320 --> 00:45:08,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget that.</font>

1065
00:45:08,960 --> 00:45:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quit dodging the question.</font>

1066
00:45:09,960 --> 00:45:11,130
