<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I landed.</font>

1070
00:45:24,440 --> 00:45:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I...</font>

1071
00:45:25,030 --> 00:45:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had to stop by work first</font>

1072
00:45:26,070 --> 00:45:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and check on everyone, didn't I?</font>

1073
00:45:27,030 --> 00:45:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

1074
00:45:27,560 --> 00:45:29,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Without me, they'd be lost.</font>

1075
00:45:29,670 --> 00:45:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm coming home now. Right now.</font>

1076
00:45:31,670 --> 00:45:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao.</font>

1077
00:45:32,440 --> 00:45:33,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did his phone ring?</font>

1078
00:45:33,800 --> 00:45:34,380
